 "text": "Monroe County, OH Official Website\nSkip to main content\nHome\nGovernment\nAuditor's Office\nClerk of Courts\nCommon Pleas Court\nProbate Juvenile Court\nCounty Court\nCommissioners\nBoard of Elections\nProbation Dept.\nProsecutor\nRecorder\nEngineer\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nWoodsfield P.D.\nBoard of Developmental Disabilities\nLand Bank\nDepartments\nEconomic Development\nEducation\nO.S.U. Extension\nEMA\nHealth Department\nIT Support\nJob and Family Services\nParks and Recreation\nTax Map Department\nVeteran's Office\nPublic Transportation Buckeye-Southeast Transit\nMonroe Soil and Water\nDog Warden\nMonroe County EMS Association\nFamily and Children First\nResidents\nAbout Us\nCalendar\nCounty Fair\nJob and Family Services\nLocal Businesses\nMonroe Beacon\nParks and Recreation\nChamber of Commerce\nMonroe County History\nContact Us\nCounty Directory\nCounty Email\nVisitors\nAbout Us\nContact Us\nCounty Fair\nLocal Businesses\nLodging\nMonroe Beacon\nParks and Recreation\nTourism\nRecycle Ohio\nSearch\nSearch\nslide 1 of 8\nWELCOME TO\nMONROE COUNTY\nslide 1 to 3 of 3\nEconomic\ndevelopment\nCounty Directory\nEmergency Notifications (NOW LIVE)\nMONROE COUNTY!\nMonroe County is celebrating its 250th birthday (Semiquincentennial) with area events.\nCounty residents are stepping up and beautifying Monroe County in preparation of this historic milestone. Signs like the one on the right are being placed on county line signs and community signs throughout the county. These signs are being produced locally at MACO. These signs will remain up until the end of the year. The 250 committee are taking orders for the county wide banners in various sizes as well as selling t-shirts of the same design. Shirts can be purchased at the Monroe Arts Center at 118 South Paul Street, Woodsfield.\nYou can check out all the upcoming parade events throughout the county on the calendar below. If your event is not listed please contact the Commissioners' office so it can be added.\nRead More\nrecent news\nslide 1 to 2 of 2\nJul 10\nSouthEastern OH Joint Solid Waste Management Districts\nJul 21\nFair Housing Law & Ohio Landlord Tenant Law\nView All Recent News\nView All Events\nUPCOMING\nEVENTS & MEETINGS\n{{?it.length}}\n{{~it :event:index}}\n{{=event.start.month.short}} {{=event.start.day.num}}\n{{=event.title}}\n{{~}}\n{{?}}\nShare\nShare this page\nShare this page\n×\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.monroecountyohio.net/\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nReddit\nClose\nMonday - Friday\n8:00 AM - 4:00 PM\nView Directory\nRoom 101 N. Main St. R34\n|\nWoodsfield, Ohio 43793\nP: +1 (740) 472-1341\nPowered by revize., the Government Website Experts Login\nClose\nRead More",
